  "description": "Demolition and replacement of the existing rear shed with a single storey ground floor rear infill extension.",
  "epc_number": null,
  "ward": "Cazenove Ward",
  "last_updated": "2026-11-18T11:16:46.826Z",
  "street_name": "FORBURG ROAD",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;﻿&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span id=&quot;docs-internal-guid-2984d451-7fff-07f2-8769-242829927ad6&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; vertical-align: baseline;&quot;&gt;The proposed development would have a detrimental impact upon the character and appearance of the host property whilst failing to preserve or enhance the character and appearance of the conservation area.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;The proposed extension due to its poor relationship with the existing first floor rear elevation window would fail to comply with London Plan policies HC1 (Heritage conservation and growth), D3 (Optimising site capacity through the design-led approach) Hackney Local Plan policies LP1 (Design quality and local character), and LP3 (Designated Heritage Assets) and the REA SPD.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: transparent; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; white-space: pre-wrap;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;",
    "The proposal would have unacceptable impacts on neighbouring amenity in the form of loss of daylight, sunlight and would be overbearing and enclosing.&amp;nbsp;The proposal would fail to meet the requirements of London Plan policy D6 (Housing quality and standards) and Hackney Local Plan policy LP2 (Development and Amenity) and the REA SPD."
  ],
